{"ticker":"TNPETRO","symbol":"TNPETRO","instrumentId":3022750,"name":"Tamilnadu Petroprod","industry":"NSE-Chemicals-Plastics","about":"Tamilnadu Petroproducts Ltd is a leading manufacturer of industrial chemicals, specializing in the production of linear alkyl benzene (LAB), caustic soda, and other petrochemical products. LAB, a key ingredient in detergents, forms the cornerstone of the company’s operations, while its caustic soda products serve industries like textiles, pulp and paper, and chemicals. Tamilnadu Petroproducts operates state-of-the-art manufacturing facilities in India, adhering to global environmental and quality standards. The company caters to both domestic and international markets, providing sustainable and high-quality chemical solutions that support various industrial processes, contributing to cleaner and more efficient manufacturing practices.","website":"www.tnpetro.com","location":"Chennai, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T14:02:42.704Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":111.57,"changePct":2.4423836195023383,"week52High":139.18,"week52Low":79.9},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,004 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹2,263 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"58,481,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"48"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"9,919,587"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"1.34%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"0.99"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"15.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.05"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.95"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-9%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"5.8"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"5–27"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"9.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"-11.12"},{"label":"Volume","value":"137,556"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"1,168,758"},{"label":"Master score","value":"67"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"65"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"73"},{"label"